Tamsin Vey does not look up at once. She finishes stamping a slip, squares it against a stack, and only then lets her eyes find you. Behind her, a water-ration notice hangs from a hook, its corners curled. <npc>"Kestrel,"</npc> she says, tasting it. <npc>"Folk who come asking after my name usually want something I've already sold twice."</npc> Her hand rests on a closed ledger, and she does not move it.

*If you want her on your side, this could be a Make a Connection.*

