The Kobayashi IV drops off the lane and follows the bearing through the dark. A debris field opens ahead, metallic wreckage turning slowly among mineral rock. In the middle hangs the clipped hauler, hull split along one flank. The call is coming from her, and its beat falters, then steadies. Something in the wreck has just answered your approach with a pulse of power. A single running light blinks on, green, and holds.

